st visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\",\"references\":[\"(a)\",\"(4)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:7d94e2d2b05d395f143a272122eb562e4ecdf59df2701e848148ccc669b2a51c\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) For a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises, the organizer must satisfy all of the following conditions:\",\"(4) Before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises, before admitting the first visitor\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":756,\"summary\":\"For a temporary display open to the public after sunset on agency premises, before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
